{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a deep breath and step into a tiny world that moves at its own pace. Feed animals, plant trees, listen to the wind, and watch your forest grow - even when you\u2019re not there. A soothing experience for anyone who just wants to slow down and reconnect with nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alborada is a small game  with simple objectives. Plant your forest, get to know its flora and fauna, and solve simple puzzles to unlock new species to personalize your world. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/7d828cd23eeb5282939dbc356c90c15d.poster.avif?t=1762706844\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/7d828cd23eeb5282939dbc356c90c15d.webm?t=1762706844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/7d828cd23eeb5282939dbc356c90c15d.mp4?t=1762706844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/16bef6ae8bf543d8219450918efde1d7.avif?t=1762706844\" width=1280 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden treasures scattered through the forest. Collect, trade, and share them to unlock new life \u2014 plants, animals, and surprises waiting beneath the leaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/34e84fc0db068e27efe0148eeded6abb.poster.avif?t=1762706844\" width=1090 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/34e84fc0db068e27efe0148eeded6abb.webm?t=1762706844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/34e84fc0db068e27efe0148eeded6abb.mp4?t=1762706844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/c8e017a5678de7901e43bb2209113f4e.avif?t=1762706844\" width=1280 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your friends achieve their small goals, play with them, or let them wander freely through the forest. There are no wrong choices - no rush, no danger. Just you, your friends, and the gentle song of the birds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/106a261b5c8b9a0e58da089073f4acf0.poster.avif?t=1762706844\" width=978 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/106a261b5c8b9a0e58da089073f4acf0.webm?t=1762706844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/106a261b5c8b9a0e58da089073f4acf0.mp4?t=1762706844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/67cb5eb00c50c432766adc278be29da7.avif?t=1762706844\" width=1280 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax as you interact with the environment. Play with time and weather to create your ideal atmosphere - focus on your tasks, or simply unwind and meditate to the sounds of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the life around you: feed curious animals, watch their reactions, and build quiet connections with the creatures that share your forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/98c000be69e3c632ae7891b50b236c32.poster.avif?t=1762706844\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/98c000be69e3c632ae7891b50b236c32.webm?t=1762706844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/98c000be69e3c632ae7891b50b236c32.mp4?t=1762706844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Field recording library:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The field recording library is an ongoing project of sound recordings from the different parts of the Iberian Peninsula. Enjoy the meadows, forests, lakes, rivers, and other natural sounds anywhere you go by using the app in Audio Player mode to roam freely through the library or Game Mode to create a perfect mix of sounds.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Alborada is a cross-platform idle game &amp; audio player that runs on Linux, Windows and Android devices.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2566370?t=1762706844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2566370?t=1762706844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/0102e7579e3d5874bb273b12722e9ac0a8cf8484/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762706844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/0102e7579e3d5874bb273b12722e9ac0a8cf8484/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762706844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller sup