sks, or simply unwind and meditate to the sounds of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the life around you: feed curious animals, watch their reactions, and build quiet connections with the creatures that share your forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/98c000be69e3c632ae7891b50b236c32.poster.avif?t=1762706844\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/98c000be69e3c632ae7891b50b236c32.webm?t=1762706844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/98c000be69e3c632ae7891b50b236c32.mp4?t=1762706844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Field recording library:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The field recording library is an ongoing project of sound recordings from the different parts of the Iberian Peninsula. Enjoy the meadows, forests, lakes, rivers, and other natural sounds anywhere you go by using the app in Audio Player mode to roam freely through the library or Game Mode to create a perfect mix of sounds.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Alborada is a cross-platform idle game &amp; audio player that runs on Linux, Windows and Android devices.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Eugeni Lvov"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/acd27ed5386fcca64810e4e08650c315649b7959/header.jpg?t=1762706844","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 Eugeni Lvov, All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X86 / X64 